<title>ITALY: Air France names new general manager for Italy.</title>
<headline>Air France names new general manager for Italy.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air France has named Philippe Hache its new general manager for Italy.</p>
<p>Hache, an economist, has been with Air France since 1969,becoming general manager of Air Charter in 1987 and manager of scheduled services and European markets for the French carrier in 1992 - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel:44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
